#: app/api/formulas.py:12 app/api/formulas.py:32
msgid ""
"Normalized Difference Vegetation Index shows the amount of green vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Der normalisierte Differenzvegetationsindex zeigt die Menge an grüner "
"Vegetation."

#: app/api/formulas.py:17
msgid ""
"Normalized difference yellowness index (NDYI), best model variability in "
"relative yield potential in Canola."
msgstr ""
"Normalisierter Differenz-Gelbheitsindex (NDYI), beste Modellvariabilität im "
"relativen Ertragspotenzial bei Raps."

#: app/api/formulas.py:22
msgid ""
"Normalized Difference Red Edge Index shows the amount of green vegetation of "
"permanent or later stage crops."
msgstr ""
"Der Normalized Difference Red Edge Index (NDRI) zeigt den Anteil grüner "
"Vegetation bei Dauerkulturen oder Kulturpflanzen im späteren "
"Wachstumsstatium an."

#: app/api/formulas.py:27
msgid ""
"Normalized Difference Water Index shows the amount of water content in water "
"bodies."
msgstr ""
"Der Normalized Difference Water Index zeigt den Wassergehalt in Gewässern."

#: app/api/formulas.py:37
msgid ""
"Enhanced Normalized Difference Vegetation Index is like NDVI, but uses Blue "
"and Green bands instead of only Red to isolate plant health."
msgstr ""
"Der verbesserte normalisierte Differenzvegetationsindex ähnelt dem NDVI, "
"verwendet jedoch blaue und grüne Bänder anstelle von nur roten, um die "
"Pflanzengesundheit zu isolieren."

#: app/api/formulas.py:41
msgid ""
"Visible NDVI is an un-normalized index for RGB sensors using constants "
"derived from citrus, grape, and sugarcane crop data."
msgstr ""
"Visible NDVI ist ein nicht normalisierter Index für RGB-Sensoren, der von "
"Ertragsdaten von Zitrusgewächsen, Trauben und Zuckerrohr abgeleitete "
"Konstanten verwendet."

#: app/api/formulas.py:45
msgid "Visual Atmospheric Resistance Index shows the areas of vegetation."
msgstr "Der Visual Atmospheric Resistance Index zeigt die Vegetationsflächen."

#: app/api/formulas.py:50
msgid "Modified Photochemical Reflectance Index"
msgstr "Modifizierter photochemischer Reflexionsindex"

#: app/api/formulas.py:55
msgid ""
"Excess Green Index (derived from only the RGB bands) emphasizes the "
"greenness of leafy crops such as potatoes."
msgstr ""
"Excess Green Index (nur von den RGB-Kanälen abgeleitet) betont das Grün von "
"Blattfrüchten wie Kartoffeln."

#: app/api/formulas.py:59
msgid ""
"Burn Area Index hightlights burned land in the red to near-infrared spectrum."
msgstr ""
"Der Burn Area Index hebt verbrannte Erde im Rot bis Nahinfrarot-Spektrum "
"hervor."

#: app/api/formulas.py:63
msgid "Green Leaf Index shows greens leaves and stems."
msgstr "Der Green Leaf Index zeigt grüne Blätter und Stängel."

#: app/api/formulas.py:68
msgid ""
"Green Normalized Difference Vegetation Index is similar to NDVI, but "
"measures the green spectrum instead of red."
msgstr ""
"Der Vegetationsindex für normalisierte grüne Unterschiede ähnelt dem NDVI, "
"misst jedoch das grüne Spektrum anstelle von rot."

#: app/api/formulas.py:73
msgid ""
"Green Ratio Vegetation Index is sensitive to photosynthetic rates in forests."
msgstr ""
"Der Green Ratio Vegetaion Index (GRVI) eignet sich zur Visualisierung von "
"Photosyntheseraten in Wäldern"

#: app/api/formulas.py:77
msgid ""
"Soil Adjusted Vegetation Index is similar to NDVI but attempts to remove the "
"effects of soil areas using an adjustment factor (0.5)."
msgstr ""
"Der Soil Adjusted Vegetation Index ähnelt dem NDVI, versucht aber, die "
"Einflüsse von Bodenflächen mit einem Korrekturfaktor (0,5) zu entfernen."

#: app/api/formulas.py:81
msgid ""
"Modified Non-Linear Index improves the Non-Linear Index algorithm to account "
"for soil areas."
msgstr ""
"Der Modified Non-Linear Index verbessert den Non-Linear-Index-Algorithmus, "
"um Bodenflächen zu berücksichtigen."

#: app/api/formulas.py:85
msgid ""
"Modified Simple Ratio is an improvement of the Simple Ratio (SR) index to be "
"more sensitive to vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Die Modified Simple Ratio ist eine Verbesserung des Simple-Ratio-Index (SR), "
"die empfindlicher auf Vegetation reagiert."

#: app/api/formulas.py:89
msgid ""
"Renormalized Difference Vegetation Index uses the difference between near-IR "
"and red, plus NDVI to show areas of healthy vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Der Renormalized Difference Vegetation Index nutzt die Differenz zwischen "
"Nahinfrarot und Rot sowie den NDVI, um Flächen mit gesunder Vegetation "
"anzuzeigen."

#: app/api/formulas.py:93
msgid ""
"Transformed Difference Vegetation Index highlights vegetation cover in urban "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"Der Transformed Difference Vegetation Index hebt die Vegetationsbedeckung in "
"städtischen Gebieten hervor."

#: app/api/formulas.py:97
msgid ""
"Optimized Soil Adjusted Vegetation Index is based on SAVI, but tends to work "
"better in areas with little vegetation where soil is visible."
msgstr ""
"Der Optimized Soil Adjusted Vegetation Index basiert auf SAVI, funktioniert "
"aber meist besser in Gebieten mit wenig Vegetation, in denen der Boden "
"sichtbar ist."

#: app/api/formulas.py:101
msgid "Leaf Area Index estimates foliage areas and predicts crop yields."
msgstr "Der Leaf Area Index schätzt Blattflächen und sagt Ernteerträge voraus."

#: app/api/formulas.py:106
msgid ""
"Enhanced Vegetation Index is useful in areas where NDVI might saturate, by "
"using blue wavelengths to correct soil signals."
msgstr ""
"Der Enhanced Vegetation Index ist nützlich in Gebieten, in denen der NDVI "
"sättigen könnte, da er blaue Wellenlängen zur Korrektur von Bodensignalen "
"nutzt."

#: app/api/formulas.py:111
msgid ""
"Atmospherically Resistant Vegetation Index. Useful when working with imagery "
"for regions with high atmospheric aerosol content."
msgstr ""
"Atmospherically Resistant Vegetation Index. Nützlich bei Bildern von "
"Regionen mit hohem atmosphärischem Aerosolgehalt."

